# Pokoin/CardVault Workflows

- Read `workflows/README.md` before deploy, Supabase/CardTrader import, or domain redirect work.
- Do not deploy the web app with plain `vercel deploy`. Use `workflows/deploy-web.sh` or `deploy-pokoin-web.sh`.
- Keep account/auth/wallet/profile/checkout/orders canonical on `https://pokoin.com`; alternate subdomains must redirect protected routes there.
- Never print `.env.local` secrets. Read env names/shape only, or pass values directly to commands.
- Use CardTrader scripts for blueprint refresh:
  - `workflows/download-cardtrader-pokemon-blueprints.sh`
  - `workflows/upload-cardtrader-blueprints-to-supabase.sh`
  - `workflows/verify-supabase-cardtrader-blueprints.sh`
- The old Supabase project `msngrrrihwudtnyjatlo` is unrecoverable/inactive; use the active project from `.env.local`.
- Cloudflare Worker routes need proxied DNS records. Deploying a Worker route alone does not make an unresolved domain work.
